### FindAllRoles
POST http://localhost/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query FindAllRoles { findAllRoles { id name } }"
}

### FindRolesByUserId #1
POST http://localhost/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query FindRolesByUserId($id: ID!) { findRolesByUserId(id: $id) { id name } }",
  "variables": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### FindRolesByUserId #2
POST http://localhost/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query FindRolesByUserId($id: ID!) { findRolesByUserId(id: $id) { id name } }",
  "variables": {
